live-snap: worklist-reading-016-40x12
expect: RISK WORKLIST
expect: q back
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/worklist_reading.py @TMP_TARGET @ART worklist-reading default
ask: Are complete paths, raw contributor values, uncertainty and contributor status readable through keyboard paging at all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/worklist_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART child-context @TMP_HOME @REPO/target/debug/kuzushi
submit: logs
submit: run worklist:rank {"target":"child","limit":1}
require-live-snap: 25 1 of 1 ranked file(s) shown | child-ranking
submit: worklist
require-live-snap: 25 4 of 4 ranked files shown | parent-ranking-retained
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/worklist_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART child
ask: Does explicit child ranking use child context while the parent gallery retains its own evidence and the child run remains inspectable in its receipt?
submit: logs
submit: run worklist:rank {"includeFanIn":true}
require-live-snap: 25 not implemented | unsupported-contributor
submit: run coverage:recommend {"limit":0}
require-live-snap: 25 must be at least 1 | invalid-limit
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/worklist_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART malformed
submit: run coverage:recommend
require-live-snap: 25 schema version 0 | malformed-read-refused
submit: run worklist:rank
submit: worklist
require-live-snap: 25 degraded: | degraded-worklist
ask: Do invalid options fail clearly and malformed coverage history remain disclosed while other ranking evidence stays usable?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/worklist_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART repair
submit: logs
submit: run coverage:recommend {"limit":1}
require-live-snap: 25 recommendation(s) | repaired-recommendations
submit: run worklist:rank {"limit":4}
submit: worklist
require-live-snap: 25 C scan never-scanned | repaired-ranking
expect: 4 of 4 ranked files shown
expect-not: degraded:
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/worklist_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART repaired
ask: Is recovery explicit, with the malformed database unchanged by reads and a separately recorded fixture repair before successful reruns?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: worklist
require-live-snap: 25 4 of 4 ranked files shown | recovered-reading
expect: A 42/100
expect-not: no risk worklist
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/worklist_audit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart reconstruct advisory ranking from saved context and preserve receipts without model calls, scans, source execution or invented findings?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
